      "chunk_type": "text",
      "text": "Tap an app to specify which notifications you want to receive and set the badge style based on your preferences and usage habits. Tap \"Default channel\" to adjust more detailed settings. • If you choose \"Number\", the number of unread notifications will be displayed on the top right of the app icon. If you choose \"Dot\", a red dot will be displayed to indicate unread notifications. You can also choose to not show a badge to keep the home screen simple and clean.",
